{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Gerrit PS6 LLM-Review +1 advisory dispositions: (1) ACCEPTED BY CONTRACT — public RebarError(returncode=2) for operational Git/ref failures is required by decision 3; MCP intentionally exposes the shared command_failed envelope. (2) FIXED — added the null forward Jira-key case to schema-valid corrupt-key coverage and mutation-proved it. (3) FIXED — added real public library and MCP missing-tickets-ref coverage: the library raises RebarError(returncode=2), while MCP raises ToolError caused by McpEnvelopeError(command_failed); mutation proved the test fails if the library swallows the error. Validation is green: 41 focused bridge-fsck tests, 227 changed-surface tests, lint, raw-git policy, and mypy over 494 files."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786390353922454001,"uuid":"e0c35058-f353-4531-a521-d002d6638fdf"}